    "为保护隐私，本次请求未发送到模型。首次外发需要确认：确认后将把以下内容发送到「%@」（模型：%@）：\n%@\n用途：%@\n请在弹窗中选择「允许一次」或「允许并记住」，或到「设置 → OpenAI 兼容接口」查看隐私选项。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For privacy, this request was not sent to the model. The first external request requires confirmation: after confirmation, the following content will be sent to \"%@\" (model: %@):\n%@\nPurpose: %@\nSelect \"Allow Once\" or \"Always Allow\" in the dialog, or review privacy options under \"Settings → OpenAI-Compatible API\"."
