    "仅在打开歌曲信息、歌曲鉴赏等需要公开音乐资料的功能时按需查询。不会上传音频文件、歌词、播放地址、NAS 密码或完整音乐库。查询结果默认缓存 14 天。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Queries only run on demand when you open features that need public music data, such as song info and song appreciation. Audio files, lyrics, stream URLs, NAS passwords, or your full library are never uploaded. Results are cached for 14 days by default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "僅在打開歌曲資訊、歌曲鑑賞等需要公開音樂資料的功能時按需查詢。不會上傳音訊檔案、歌詞、播放位址、NAS 密碼或完整音樂庫。查詢結果預設快取 14 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
