    "内网和外网会同时探测。内网在 30 秒内可达时优先使用；只有内网确认不可达时才使用外网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both LAN and WAN are probed. The LAN is used first when reachable within 30 seconds; the WAN is used only when the LAN is confirmed unreachable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "內網和外網會同時探測。內網在 30 秒內可達時優先使用；只有內網確認不可達時才使用外網。"
