            "value" : "基本資訊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写内网地址及可选外网地址后，Auralis 会同时探测两端；内网 30 秒内可达则优先使用，内网不可达才降级外网。外网请填写完整的 http:// 或 https:// 地址；HTTPS 更安全，HTTP 会明文传输调用 Token。Agent 会通过插件搜索并下载到 NAS 音乐目录（仅下载，不刮削/整理）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After entering a LAN address and an optional WAN address, Auralis probes both; the LAN is preferred when reachable within 30 seconds, falling back to the WAN only when unreachable. Use a full http:// or https:// URL for the WAN; HTTPS is safer since HTTP sends your call token in plain text. The agent searches and downloads via plugins into your NAS music directory (download only, no scraping/organizing)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "填寫內網位址及可選外網位址後，Auralis 會同時探測兩端；內網 30 秒內可達則優先使用，內網不可達才降級外網。外網請填寫完整的 http:// 或 https:// 位址；HTTPS 更安全，HTTP 會明文傳輸呼叫 Token。Agent 會通過外掛搜尋並下載到 NAS 音樂目錄（僅下載，不刮削/整理）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
