          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cover art comes from server metadata; see the server's song info for detailed sources."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "封面來自伺服器中繼資料；詳細來源見伺服器歌曲資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除当前服务器的所有 V2 分类与 AI 标签。音乐库、下载、播放记录和其他服务器的索引不会受影响；之后可重新开始索引。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This deletes all V2 categories and AI tags for the current server. Your music library, downloads, playback history, and indexes of other servers are unaffected; you can restart indexing later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將刪除目前伺服器的所有 V2 分類與 AI 標籤。音樂庫、下載、播放記錄和其他伺服器的索引不會受影響；之後可重新開始索引。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除本机保存的登录凭据、离线目录与缓存；服务器上的音乐、歌单与收藏不会被删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Local login credentials, offline library data, and caches will be removed; music, playlists, and favorites on the server are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將刪除本機儲存的登入憑證、離線目錄與快取；伺服器上的音樂、歌單與收藏不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除本机已下载的临时音频缓存文件；用户主动下载的离线音乐不会被删除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temporarily cached audio files on this device will be deleted; user-downloaded offline music is not removed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將刪除本機已下載的臨時音訊快取檔案；使用者主動下載的離線音樂不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除本机已缓存的全部封面图片。今后封面只按需从服务器加载，不再主动缓存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All cached cover images on this device will be deleted. Covers will be loaded from the server on demand in the future."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將刪除本機已快取的全部封面圖片。今後封面只按需從伺服器載入，不再主動快取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将恢复：App 设置、音乐服务器、大模型与音乐下载配置。不会覆盖或删除本地数据库、歌曲、歌单、收藏、播放记录、缓存或下载文件。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This restores: App settings, music servers, model configuration, and music download config. It will not overwrite or delete your local database, songs, playlists, favorites, playback history, cache, or downloaded files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將還原：App 設定、音樂伺服器、大型語言模型與音樂下載設定。不會覆蓋或刪除本機資料庫、歌曲、歌單、收藏、播放記錄、快取或下載檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将恢复：服务器信息、大模型配置与其他设置。不会覆盖或删除歌曲、歌单、收藏与播放记录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This restores: server info, model configuration, and other settings. It will not overwrite or delete songs, playlists, favorites, or playback history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "將還原：伺服器資訊、大型語言模型設定與其他設定。不會覆蓋或刪除歌曲、歌單、收藏與播放記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将清空本机目录并从服务器重新拉取全部数据，耗时较长。服务器数据不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
